From b385627e01d650b92ff72bed62888af3846b6213 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:38:35 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 398/404] Unified: sweep carries the solids of a compound that
 sit in the moving parts

All the bolts of a model in one compound: those of the hub stayed behind
and were hit by the hub at each angle. carry={"from": [...], "inside":
[...], "margin": mm} moves the solids of those parts whose centre is in
the box of the moving parts; the others stay and are still checked.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
